<title>USA: Meridian shares to cease trading on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Meridian shares to cease trading on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>VONORE, Tenn 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Sports Inc said Friday that its shares would cease trading on Nasdaq, effective Friday after the close of trading.</p>
<p>The company, which makes and markets specialized boats and recreation equipment, said it expects its shares to be traded on the OTC Bulletin Board.</p>
</text>
